    "body": "Something like this should work:\r\n\r\n```fish\r\n# config.fish\r\nset -x STARSHIP_FISH_PRIVATE_MODE $fish_private_mode\r\nfunction __starship_is_private_hook --on-variable fish_private_mode\r\n    set -x STARSHIP_FISH_PRIVATE_MODE $fish_private_mode\r\nend\r\n```\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# starship.toml\r\n[custom.fish_private]\r\ncommand = \"echo 'private'\"\r\nshell = [\"sh\", \"--norc\"]\r\nwhen = 'test \"${STARSHIP_FISH_PRIVATE_MODE}\" == \"1\"'\r\n```",
