    "updated_at": "2021-02-02T12:23:33Z",
    "body": "Ended up using this:\r\n\r\n`fish.config`\r\n\r\n```fish\r\n    # publish fish_private_mode\r\n    if test -n \"$fish_private_mode\"\r\n        set -x FISH_PRIVATE_MODE $fish_private_mode\r\n    end\r\n```\r\n\r\n`starship.toml`\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.fish_private]\r\nwhen = 'test -n \"$FISH_PRIVATE_MODE\"'\r\ndescription = \"Indicates that fish shell is in private mode\"\r\nsymbol = \"﫸 \"\r\nstyle = \"purple\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nSymbol is [nerdfonts](https://www.nerdfonts.com/cheat-sheet)`nf-mdi-incognito` / `0xfaf8`",
